  *       shadow registers until RTC_DR is read (LL_RTC_ReadReg(RTC, DR)).
  * @rmtoll RTC_TR           PM            LL_RTC_TIME_GetFormat
  * @param  RTCx RTC Instance
  * @retval Returned value can be one of the following values:
