       thanks to:
      (##) DMA1 or DMA2: __HAL_RCC_DMA1_CLK_ENABLE() or  __HAL_RCC_DMA2_CLK_ENABLE();

   (#) Use HAL_DMA_GetState() function to return the DMA state and HAL_DMA_GetError() in case of error
