/**
  * @brief  Select the clock source to output on MCO1 pin(PA8) or MC02 pin (PA10)(*).
  * @note   PA8, PA10(*) should be configured in alternate function mode.
  * @param  RCC_MCOx  specifies the output direction for the clock source.
