    [..]
    This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to initialize the USARTx or the UARTy
    in asynchronous mode.
      (+) For the asynchronous mode the parameters below can be configured:
        (++) Baud Rate
        (++) Word Length
        (++) Stop Bit
